FOOTBALL MATCH DATA ATTRIBUTION & LICENSE NOTICE
=================================================

The CSV files in this directory are sourced from football-data.co.uk:

  https://www.football-data.co.uk/mmz4281/<season>/<league>.csv

where <season> is one of 2122, 2223, 2324, 2425 and <league> is one of:

  E0   English Premier League      -> soccer_epl
  SP1  Spanish La Liga             -> soccer_spain_la_liga
  D1   German Bundesliga           -> soccer_germany_bundesliga
  I1   Italian Serie A             -> soccer_italy_serie_a
  F1   French Ligue 1              -> soccer_france_ligue_one

