These files contain pre-match closing odds from the following bookmakers
(real prices as published):
  B365  Bet365,   BW   Bet&Win,   PS  Pinnacle,  WH   William Hill,  VC  VC Bet
plus the official final result (FTR: H/D/A) and scorelines (FTHG/FTAG).

No synthetic, simulated, or future-dated fixtures are present. Match IDs,
teams, dates, odds, and results are exactly as downloaded.

